timization) focuses on structuring content so answer engines can extract clear, direct responses to user questions. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) focuses on making your expertise, entities, and supporting evidence easier for generative AI systems to understand and cite accurately. Both work best when built on strong SEO fundamentals.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you work with US and international audiences?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. SEO, AEO, and GEO strategies can be tailored for US and international markets based on your goals, audience, language, and available information.\"}}]}24:[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/seo-digital-marketing#webpage\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SEO & Digital Marketing\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Data-informed SEO, AEO, GEO, and digital marketing strategies designed to improve visibility in traditional search, answer engines, and generative AI experiences.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/seo-digital-marketing\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\\\"},\\\"about\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\\\"},\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Service\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"SEO & Digital Marketing\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Data-informed SEO, AEO, GEO, and digital marketing strategies designed to improve visibility in traditional search, answer engines, and generative AI experiences.\\\",\\\"serviceType\\\":\\\"SEO & Marketing\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/seo-digital-marketing\\\",\\\"provider\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\\\"}