commendations, and campaign direction.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Measurement\",{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-border p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-gold\",\"children\":[\"0\",4]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 font-semibold text-navy\",\"children\":\"Measurement\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\",\"children\":\"We help you track meaningful metrics and refine strategy over time across search experiences.\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"section-pad bg-surface\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-tight grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\",\"children\":\"FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \",\"children\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-muted\",\"children\":[\"Clear answers to common questions about \",\"seo & digital marketing\",\".\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L2f\",null,{\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can you guarantee #1 rankings or AI citations?\",\"a\":\"No. Ethical providers cannot guarantee specific rankings, answer placement, or AI citations. Search engines and AI systems control their own results. MIQ Enterprises LLC focuses on best practices: helpful content, technical quality, clear structure, entity clarity, and measurable progress.\"},{\"q\":\"What are AEO and GEO?\",\"a\":\"AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) focuses on structuring content so answer engines can extract clear, direct responses to user questions. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) focuses on making your expertise, entities, and supporting evidence easier for generative AI systems to understand and cite accurately. Both work best when built on strong SEO fundamentals.\"},{\"q\":\"Do you work with US and international audiences?\",\"a\":\"Yes. SEO, AEO, and GEO strategies can be tailored for US and international markets based on your goals, audience, language, and available information.\"}]}]]}]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"section-pad \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-tight \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\",\"children\":\"Related\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \",\"children\":\"Related services\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2b\",\"wikipedia-services\",{\"href\":\"/services/wikipedia-services\",\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition hover:border-electric/40 hover:shadow-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display font-semibold text-navy\",\"children\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page maintenance for companies, brands, executives, and organizations in the United States and internationally.\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\",\"children\":[\"Explore \",[\"$\",\"$L2c\",null,{\"icon\":{\"name\":\"arrow-right\",\"size\":24,\"node\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M5 12h14\",\"key\":\"1ays0h\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\",\"key\":\"xquz4c\"}]]},\"className\":\"transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\",\"size\":16}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L2b\",\"website-development\",{\"href\":\"/services/website-development\",\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 t